      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那仿佛要进行严格审视的眼神，让人感到紧张。\n但是……如果是唯独爱你的话，\n一定能在海外获胜，我对此深信不疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76c2f28c8fe0cd0e43031054aa574e5c13908c43ea51f0bd89b698e953c7a46b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
