      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『架桥，交涉辛苦啦……』\n『允许直播的设施也已经挑选完毕咯』\n『就选最好的一家吧！』『好期待啊～』",
      "source_fingerprint": "933f120cb0725229f7ff5f5343a73a6f58640c8e0b7855dd2a4d6864061bd48f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
