    {
      "uid": "zhcn:148af31588b76eb2f66a1bf0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了朝着进军海外努力的唯独爱你，\n想为她做些什么……这就是\n最近我和社区成员们的烦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad545c6637be28bfe7c8c5cf4dcfeef4128fff49a7390220d558afe06ffec22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
