      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——好！ 接下来是心理训练！\n大家，现在开始设想一下海外比赛的场景，\n能为我营造一个『客场环境』吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a22ffd42d5d52b6e0d84ba1dd9d25c4aaf422b9909c2ea248204552495a2366",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
